WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.560
This lady is not going to Pitbull bald after all, because I found a tutorial on how to make a bald head out of foil.

2
00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:12.740
First I made this bun, the thinnest possible, and now I will wrap it in foil, I guess.

3
00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:30.500
Okay, now we will poke a hole here for the ear, because I cannot hear anything, as if my ear is in a bag, although technically it is.

4
00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:41.680
You see, these are the situations where you need cheap make-up products, because I do not mind squeezing out as much of this as needed.

5
00:00:42.140 --> 00:00:44.580
This might actually work.

6
00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:50.280
This is the first layer, I do not know how it looks from behind, but I will do a second layer anyway.

7
00:00:50.920 --> 00:00:57.500
I cannot believe I do not have an ordinary white shirt or an ordinary black tie, but then there are no excuses either.

8
00:00:57.640 --> 00:01:00.420
I am Pitbull tonight.
